HB0211 Hunting wildlife from vehicles.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Allemand, Angelos and Johnson and
Senator(s) Ide and Laursen, D
AN ACT relating to game and fish; authorizing persons to hunt specified animals
from aircraft, automotive vehicles, trailers, motor-propelled wheeled vehicles
or snowmobiles; and providing for an effective date.
